# Classic and modern subcommand layouts, all with trailing periods
READ C1 C2
1 2.1
2 3.9
3 6.2
4 7.8
5 10.1
END

Regress C2 1 C1;
  Fits C3;
  Residuals C4;
  Constant;
  MSE K1;
  RSquared K2.

# the same model on one line, then the modern form
REGRESS C2 1 C1; FITS C5; RSQUARED K3.
Regress;
  Response C2;
  Nodefault;
  Continuous C1;
  Terms C1;
  Rsquared K4.
Describe C2.
